flowchart TD
  USER[Operator frozen behavior] --> REG[Owned workspace acceptance registry]
  MODEL[SMELTER agent] --> EDIT[Editable subject and local tests]
  EDIT --> SNAP[Fresh read-only source snapshots]
  REG --> PIN[Pinned controller verifier and subject path]
  PIN --> ISOLATE[Separate no-network acceptance runner]
  SNAP --> LOCAL[Editable test suite result]
  SNAP --> ISOLATE
  LOCAL --> COMBINE[Combined validation receipt]
  ISOLATE --> COMBINE
  COMBINE --> BOTH{Both layers pass?}
  BOTH -->|Yes| GREEN[GREEN within tested scope]
  BOTH -->|No| FAIL[RED or ERROR with exact evidence]
  FINISH[Native response ended] --> VIEW[Live task outcome]
  GREEN --> VIEW
  FAIL --> VIEW
  VIEW --> NEED[Changes needed, not verified, or checks passed]
